---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Beliefs | nidhi" description="What we believe at nidhi: honest personal finance tools, free financial literacy education, no ads, no data selling, and a blog that's free forever." keywords={['personal finance', 'financial literacy', 'money management', 'multi-currency', 'about nidhi']}>
  <section class="beliefs-page">
    <div class="beliefs-container">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-icon">
          <img src="/baba_money.webp" alt="finosopher" />
        </div>
        <h1 class="beliefs-title">What We Believe</h1>
        <p class="beliefs-intro">nidhi started because one person couldn't find a decent finance tool, and got annoyed enough to build one</p>
      </div>

      <div class="beliefs-list">
        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-teal);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>This whole thing started out of frustration</strong>
            <p>We wanted something that could help a regular person plan their money, see where it's going, and make better decisions about it. Nothing like that existed. So here we are, building it ourselves.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-deep-blue);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>Financial planning shouldn't require a financial planner</strong>
            <p>Whether you just landed your first job or you're five years from retirement, you deserve tools and guidance that actually make sense. Not jargon. Not upsells. Just straight answers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-teal);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>Built for everyone tech keeps forgetting</strong>
            <p>A lot of apps conveniently forget that money tools should work whether you're colour blind, use a screen reader, or wired differently. Being queer, neurodivergent, and a person of colour, we never had that luxury. Leaving anyone out of their own money just feels cheap.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-deep-blue);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>The blog is free, forever</strong>
            <p>No paywalls, no "subscribe for the good stuff" nonsense. If something we wrote helped you make a better decision, even if you never touch our product, that's the whole point. Tell us about it. We run on that kind of fuel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-danger);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>No ads, no data selling, no asterisks</strong>
            <p>We don't run ads. We don't sell your data. We don't do that creepy thing where you search "term insurance" and then see ads for it everywhere for a week. Your finances are your business. Literally.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!--<div class="belief" style="&#45;&#45;accent: var(&#45;&#45;color-teal);">-->
        <!--  <div class="belief-icon">-->
        <!--    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>-->
        <!--  </div>-->
        <!--  <div class="belief-body">-->
        <!--    <strong>Your money doesn't stay in one currency. Neither do we</strong>-->
        <!--    <p>Whether you're an expat, a freelancer with international clients, or just someone who travels and invests across borders, most finance tools pretend that doesn't happen. We built nidhi with multicurrency from day one because we needed it ourselves.</p>-->
        <!--  </div>-->
        <!--</div>-->

        <div class="belief" style="--accent: var(--color-deep-blue);">
          <div class="belief-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="belief-body">
            <strong>Made in Prague, powered by word of mouth</strong>
            <p>No VC money. No growth team. No billboard on the highway. If you think nidhi is useful, tell someone. That's our primary marketing strategy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-block">
        <p class="cta-text">Convinced? Or think we're full of it?</p>
        <p class="cta-sub">Either way, we'd love to hear from you</p>
        <div class="cta-links">
          <a href="mailto:hello@nidhi.today" class="cta-link" data-attr="beliefs-cta-email">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
            Drop us a love letter
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nidhi.today" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-link" data-attr="beliefs-cta-instagram">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line></svg>
            Slide into our DMs
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .beliefs-page {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-10) var(--space-4);
  }

  .beliefs-container {
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .hero-icon {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .hero-icon img {
    width: 80px;
    height: auto;
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
  }

  .beliefs-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-deep-blue);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .beliefs-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .beliefs-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .belief {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-bg-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .belief:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .belief-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(0, 137, 123, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .belief-body {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .belief strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-deep-blue);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .belief p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .belief a {
    color: var(--color-teal);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .belief a:hover {
    color: var(--color-teal-dark);
  }

  .cta-block {
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--color-bg-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .cta-text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-deep-blue);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .cta-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--color-deep-blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-deep-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cta-link:hover {
    background: var(--color-deep-blue);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .beliefs-title { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .belief { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-4); }
    .belief-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .belief strong { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .belief p { font-size: 0.84rem; }
    .cta-links { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>